    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your supply chain logistics empire. Flip one tile at a time to unlock new buildings. Buildings produce resources. Resources are transported to the distribution centers. Distribution centers re-route products to customers. A relaxing supply chain game where you unwind while watching your empire grow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690610/extras/9f3a6ee68a34de058b06a704ce8ada1d.poster.avif?t=1748484526\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690610/extras/9f3a6ee68a34de058b06a704ce8ada1d.webm?t=1748484526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690610/extras/9f3a6ee68a34de058b06a704ce8ada1d.mp4?t=1748484526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game contains</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay of flipping tiles<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690610/extras/6794dd15e077757c8aad28884a36a7f7.avif?t=1748484526\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 upgrade options for maximum idle earnings<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690610/extras/254524a9e22044d0f0391c728b5da911.avif?t=1748484526\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple hours worth of game time between all 10 areas<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690610/extras/0bb4dbcb519726229a5d3675bf226422.avif?t=1748484526\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More rewards by unlocking ports and extra boosts for more earnings<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690610/extras/c7d4db62897a56960c75298bc1f73b89.avif?t=1748484526\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
